<title>GREECE: ATHENS BOURSE OKS NICK GALIS SA IPO.</title>
<headline>ATHENS BOURSE OKS NICK GALIS SA IPO.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange approved the initial public offering prospectus of Nickos Galis Youth Centres SA for listing on the exchange's small-cap parallel market.</p>
<p>The company of former basketball star Nick Galis will go public with an offering of 660,00 registered ordinary shares. IPO proceeds will finance the expansion of its youth camps. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
